MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

SEC-001: Revoke PUBLIC EXECUTE em todas as funções, re-grant por role
SEC-002: check_plan_limit deriva tenant_id da sessão (remove parâmetro uuid)
SEC-003: PIN bcrypt via pgcrypto, rate limiting, rehash legacy SHA-256
         (expand-migrate-contract: mantém p_pin_hash como nome de parâmetro
          e preserva overload de fn_get_complaint_list para compatibilidade)
SEC-004: fn_remove_member transacional com soft-delete, proteção last-owner,
         hierarquia de roles e audit log
SEC-005: fn_prepare_campaign_send usa employee_profiles, dedup, advisory lock
SEC-006: Webhook idempotente com idempotency_key e processamento transacional

Frontend: Zod validation em updateCampaign, auth checks, RPC calls atualizados

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Q8uPeQpUhU8rprYCaRMwRp
